@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:register participation for the event;
:v1: is there a fee? ({No fee, Fee}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'No fee'])
:register a post-seminar request;
:Once you have registered a post-seminar request, the process will come to an end.;
stop
else ([v1 = 'Fee'])
:create a purchase request;
:check if the purchase request has been approved;
:v2: is purchase request approved? ({Approved, Rejected}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Approved'])
:you will receive an approved notification;
:register a post-seminar request;
:Once you have registered a post-seminar request, the process will come to an end.;
stop
else ([v2 = 'Rejected'])
:you will be notified of the rejection;
:If you receive a rejection notification, the process will come to an end.;
stop
endif
endif
@enduml